  "properties": {
    "title": "QGIS \"Ask me Anything\" session",
    "description": "This session follows on from the QGIS \"Feature Frenzy\" talk and is your once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to ask Marco Bernasocchi (QGIS.org Chairperson) and Nyall Dawson (QGIS Core Contributor) anything about QGIS.\n\nStart thinking about those burning questions that YOU want answered about QGIS and QGIS.org. Quiz us about features, how the project is run, challenges and what the future holds. We want the hard questions, the ones that keep you up at night. Don't hold back, nothing is off limits!",
